              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Set daadaŋ ŋamiae ŋakanikaomwon ka ŋitomon ka ŋiarei. Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋul, totwan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
