              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok ekiro a esapat a ŋol Noa, ebala, “A ŋalup a ŋuna adau Akuj akicen, ikiŋarakini iwon lo alotic yok a ŋolo agogoŋon a ŋolo a ŋalup a ŋuna koloŋ abu Akuj kicen.” ",
